{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28364","headline":"句溪夏日送卢霈秀才归王屋山将欲赴举 · 杜牧","name":"句溪夏日送卢霈秀才归王屋山将欲赴举","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野店正纷泊，茧蚕初引丝。\n行人碧溪渡，系马绿杨枝。\n苒苒迹始去，悠悠心所期。\n秋山念君别，惆怅桂花时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28364.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28364","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}